<section aria-labelledby="<%= guideline_anchor(:descriptions) %>">
  <h2 id="<%= guideline_anchor(:descriptions) %>">8. Descriptions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <b>Write the description yourself.</b> Do not copy text from brand websites,
      brochures, magazines or other databases. This text is protected by copyright, and it often
      reads like an advertisement (see <a href="#<%= guideline_anchor(:objectivity) %>">1.7</a>).
    </li>
    <li>
      Write about what the other fields can not show: the history of the product or brand, its
      design, special technology, and the differences from earlier models.
    </li>
    <li>Do not repeat values that are already in other fields, like price, dates or specifications.</li>
    <li>Do not add links to shops.</li>
    <li><%= render "contribute/guidelines/markdown_help" %></li>
  </ul>
</section>
